f\left(\frac{R-1+\varepsilon}{R+1-\varepsilon}\right)= f\left(\frac{R+1-\varepsilon}{R-1+\varepsilon}\right)
=\frac{1-\varepsilon}{R} \enspace.
\end{align}
}
We conclude that \eqref{eq:Target4thrm:SI4Ising} implies \eqref{eq:lemma:IsingInfNormBound}.
