for any $i\in [N]$ we have that ${\bf w}(i)\geq {\bf v}(i)$. Clearly, this implies that
\begin{align}
\norm{ \UpD}{2}=\norm{ {\bf v}}{2} \leq \norm{ {\bf w}}{2} \leq \norm{ \UpB}{2}\enspace. 
\end{align}
The above concludes the proof of \Cref{lemma:MonotonicityVs2Norm}.

